                        <item xml:id="a1">
                          <locus target="#1"/>
                          <desc type="GuestText">An incomplete prayer against eye and head pain. <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/GADX9HRE"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Chaine1912Catalogue"/><title level="m">Catalogue des manuscrits éthiopiens de la Collection Antoine d’Abbadie</title><author><forename>Marius</forename><surname>Chaîne</surname></author><pubPlace>Paris</pubPlace><publisher>Imprimerie nationale–Ernest Leroux, éditeur</publisher><date>1912</date><note type="url">https://archive.org/details/cataloguedesmanu00bibluoft</note><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Bibliothèque Nationale</note><note type="tag">bm:Chaine1912Catalogue</note></note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Bibliothèque Nationale</note><note type="tag">bm:Chaine1912Catalogue</note><citedRange unit="page">91</citedRange><citedRange unit="number">150</citedRange></bibl> defined it as 'two magic formulas'.</desc>
                          <q xml:lang="gez">ይትባረክ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ጸሎተ፡ በእንተ፡ ሕምም፡ አይን፡ ወርዕስ፡ መዕመን፡ ኦሪት፡ ወመድኃኒት፡ ዘበምራቅከ፡ ትከሥት፡ አይንተ፡ ዕዉራን፡</q>
                          <note>According to <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/QENM9ZMP"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Abbadie1859Cat"/><title level="m">Catalogue raisonné de manuscrits éthiopiens appartenant à Antoine d’Abbadie</title><author><forename>Antoine d'</forename><surname>Abbadie</surname></author><pubPlace>Paris</pubPlace><publisher>Imprimerie impériale</publisher><date>1859</date><note type="url">http://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k1044499</note><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Codicology</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Binding</note><note type="tag">Bibliothèque Nationale</note><note type="tag">bm:Abbadie1859Cat</note></note><note type="tag">Codicology</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Binding</note><note type="tag">Bibliothèque Nationale</note><note type="tag">bm:Abbadie1859Cat</note><citedRange unit="page">164</citedRange></bibl>, there were two detached folia containing another Christian prayer, which were already missing already by the time of <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/MZC4PZ7D"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:ContiRossini1914Notice"/><title level="m">Notice sur les manuscrits éthiopiens de la Collection d’Abbadie</title><title level="s">Extrait du Journal Asiatique</title><author><forename>Carlo</forename><surname>Conti Rossini</surname></author><pubPlace>Paris</pubPlace><publisher>Imprimerie nationale</publisher><date>1914</date><series><title level="s">Extrait du Journal Asiatique</title></series><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Bibliothèque Nationale</note><note type="tag">bm:ContiRossini1914Notice</note></note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Bibliothèque Nationale</note><note